  "base_expansion": "Base 'M63' expanded to standard composition: M63 minimal medium (Miller 1972): KH2PO4, (NH4)2SO4, MgSO4, FeSO4 + thiamine + carbon.",
  "verification_evidence": "5x M63 salts per liter: 10 g (NH4)2SO4, 68 g KH2PO4, 2.5 mg FeSO4.7H2O, adjust to pH 7 with KOH. Paper uses 20% of 5x = 1x, giving 2 g/L (NH4)2SO4.",
  "verification_confidence": "high",
  "base_medium": "M63 minimal medium (Elbing & Brent 2002, Current Protocols in Molecular Biology, 1.1.1-1.1.7)",
  "recuration": {
